5. NFW Profile Fitting (Section 19)  
- Implemented NFW enclosed mass model and nonlinear fitting routine.  
- Extracted structural parameters per snapshot:  
  - Scale radius (r_s)  
  - Characteristic density (ρ_s)  
  - Virial mass (M_200)  
  - Concentration (c_200)  
- Computed reduced χ² to evaluate fit quality.  
- Produced time evolution plots and overlay comparisons (data vs fit).  
- Observed deviations during merger phases and recovery post-relaxation.

