Key Insights:  
- The system exhibits strong departures from equilibrium during close encounters, captured clearly by the Jeans residual and score.  
- Tidal streams are most prominent at large radii and during dynamically active phases.  
- Kinematic mixing progresses steadily, with overlap scores approaching unity post-merger.  
- NFW fits degrade during violent phases but recover as the system relaxes, validating expected structural evolution.

